    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nBoasting a stylish rear extension and a fully converted attic, this beautifully presented home offers an exceptional standard of finish, with meticulous attention to detail evident from the moment you step inside. No. 15 White Pines Court features well-proportioned, thoughtfully designed accommodation and is ideally positioned within this ever-popular development.\n\nBuilt in 2019, the property benefits from an impressive “A” energy rating, ensuring excellent comfort, efficiency, and sustainability throughout the year.\n\nExtending to approximately 122 sq m, with an additional 24 sq m of attic space, the property offers generous and well-proportioned accommodation throughout. On entering, you are welcomed by a bright and inviting hallway leading to a spacious, elegantly appointed living room. Complete with refined décor and an electric fireplace, this room sets the tone for the quality and style found throughout the home.\n\nTo the rear, a stunning extended kitchen/dining area forms the heart of the home. This superb open-plan space is flooded with natural light and has been designed with both modern family living and entertaining in mind, offering direct access to the rear garden. A guest WC and additional storage complete the ground floor.\n\nUpstairs, there are three generously sized bedrooms, all featuring ample wardrobe space, along with a contemporary family bathroom finished to a high standard. The fully converted attic further enhances the property, providing valuable additional space ideal for a home office, playroom, or guest accommodation.\n\nExternally, the property benefits from two designated parking spaces to the front. The south-facing rear garden is designed for low maintenance and offers an ideal setting for outdoor relaxation and entertaining throughout the day.\n\nNestled at the foothills of the Dublin Mountains, White Pines offers a perfect balance of natural beauty and urban convenience. This well-established development provides a peaceful residential setting while remaining within easy reach of Dublin City Centre by both car and bus, with the M50 (Exit 12) just minutes away.\n\nA wealth of local amenities is close at hand, including Dundrum Town Centre and the vibrant villages of Knocklyon and Rathfarnham. Residents enjoy access to an excellent selection of schools, crèches, sports facilities, cafés, shops, parks, and libraries. The development also benefits from an on-site Tesco supermarket and Safari Crèche, adding further convenience for modern living.\n\nNo. 15 White Pines Court represents a superb opportunity to acquire a stylish, energy-efficient home with additional living space in a highly sought-after location."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 1.31m x 4.72\nSpacious entrance hall creating a warm and inviting environment as you enter. Complete with herringbone floor, spotlights and a large under stair storage closet.\n\nLiving Room - 3.92m x 4.25m\nAn elegant and beautifully appointed space, the living room features laminate flooring & a electric fire which forms a charming focal point, adding warmth and ambiance to the room.\n\nGuest WC - 1.65m x 1.55\nPorcelain tile floors, WC, wash hand basin.\n\nKitchen/ Dining Area - 5.16m x 6.83m\nA standout feature of this home is an extended bright and spacious open-plan kitchen & dining area, designed for both family living and entertaining. The fully fitted kitchen boasts herringbone floors, floor and eye-level units, upgraded induction hob, an island with a boiling water tap, integrated dishwasher, and sandstone countertops that combine durability with luxury. The dining area opens onto southwest facing garden and also boosts a large skylight creating a bright and airy atmosphere throughout the day. Recessed lighting completes the modern finish.\n\nBedroom One - 3.19m x 4.27m\nPrimary bedroom to the rear of the home with carpets, fitted wardrobes & ensuite.\n\nEnsuite - 2.05m x 2.11m\nPorcelain wall & floor tiling, WC, wash hand basin & pump shower, a window also provides natural light and ventilation.\n\nBedroom Two - 2.96m x 4.26m\nSpacious double room with carpet & fitted wardrobes.\n\nBedroom Three - 2.17m x 4.28m\nAnother well-proportioned bedroom with carpets & fitted wardrobes.\n\nMain Bathroom - 1.91m x 2.16m\nBeautifully finished and fully tiled, the main bathroom comprises a WC, wash-hand basin, and a bath with shower attachment. A skylight window provide both comfort and natural illumination, creating a bright and relaxing space.\n\nAttic Room - 3.94m x 4.21m\nMultipurpose attic room. Ideal as home office or playroom. The room features carpet, a walk in storage closet and a skylight.\n\n"
      },
      {
